  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-03-24T21:33:19.624Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "At some point in the last couple of months a VRchat update has meant that the AVProVideo.dll file now causes my desktop client on a Windows 7 install to crash upon entering some worlds.\nThe common theme between the worlds that cause the crash seem to be that they have all been updated in the last couple of months and use SDK3.0.\nRenaming AVProVideo.dll to AVProVideo.dll.bak now allows me to bypass the crash and enter the worlds.\nI'm assuming renaming this file prevents one type of video player from working in these worlds but since this one did not work on Windows 7 previously anyway it does not change anything for me other than preventing the client crash.",
